Lux Hair - Wear Your Crown

About the Website

Lux Hair is an online hair shopping website designed to provide customers with a convenient and trustworthy way to explore and purchase quality hair products.

The website showcases different hair styles and products, including Body Wave, Deep Wave, Straight and Curly hair.

Website Purpose

The purpose of the Lux Hair website is to:

- Showcase available hair products
- Provide customers with information about the products
- Create an easy-to-use online shopping experience
- Allow customers to make enquiries
- Present the business in a professional way

Website Features

- Home page
- Product collection
- Contact/Enquiry page
- Product images
- Navigation menu
- Responsive design for different screen sizes
- Interactive links and buttons using CSS pseudo-classes
- Mobile-friendly layout

Technologies Used
Visual studio Codes
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Responsive design and media queries
- GitHub Pages

